格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Adjust the width of dsh's reply.","id":"gh:1333049673","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-chat-width","slug":"chen-001/dsh-chat-width","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Adjust the width of dsh's reply."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-chat-width"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**中 / EN**：DSH Web 消息宽度调节插件 —— AI 回复的消息列固定宽度、屏幕再宽也是左右留白，本插件让你拖动即可调整展示宽度。\nA DSH Web plugin for adjust"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ing the message column width: AI replies render in a fixed-width centered column with empty gutters "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"on wide screens — drag to resize."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"项目概览 / Project Overview\n插件介绍 / Plugin Introduction"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 简介 / Introduction"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**中**：chat-width 是 DSH Web 的一个**客户端插件**（纯浏览器侧），解决 AI 回复消息列固定宽度导致\"表格要左右滑动、一屏信息量少、不便截图\"的痛点——让用户拖动即可调整消"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"chat-width 是 DSH Web 的一个**客户端插件**（纯浏览器侧），解决 AI 回复消息列固定宽度导致\"表格要左右滑动、一屏信息量少、不便截图\"的痛点——让用户拖动即可调整消息展示宽度。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**EN**: chat-width is a **client-side plugin** (browser-only) for DSH Web. It solves the pain of a f"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ixed-width message column — wide tables need horizontal scrolling, one screen shows too little infor"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"mation, and screenshots are hard to compose — by letting you drag to resize the message column."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 原本的痛点 / The Original Pain Points"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| 中文 | English |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| 很多表格需要左右滑动才能看到完整信息 | Many tables need horizontal scrolling to show their full content |\n| 一个屏幕下显示的"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"信息量不够多，不方便截图 | A single screen shows too little information to fit into one screenshot |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 用法 / Usage"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**中**：鼠标移到输入框左右边缘（出现竖线），按住左右拖动即可调宽——手柄虽在输入框两侧，但调整的是正文消息的宽度，正文会同步变宽/变窄。双击恢复默认。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**EN**: Move the mouse to either edge of the input box (a vertical line appears), press and drag lef"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"t/right to resize — the grips sit on the input box, but they resize the message column, so the conve"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"rsation content follows. Double-click to restore the default."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 核心功能 / Core Features"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 功能 / Feature | 说明 / Description |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 拖动手柄调宽 / Drag grips | 输入框左右边缘出现手柄，拖动即调整正文消息列宽度（手柄在输入框两侧，调的却是消息列）\nGrips appear on the input box edg"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"es; dragging resizes the message column (the grips sit on the input box, but resize the column) |\n| "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"双击恢复默认 / Double-click reset | 双击手柄恢复官方默认宽度\nDouble-click a grip to restore the official default width"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" |\n| 设置页预设 / Presets in settings | 紧凑 640 / 宽 960 / 超宽 1280 三个预设（8px 步进，320–2560px 范围）\nThree presets"},{"id":"p16s5","text":": Compact 640 / Wide 960 / Ultra 1280 (8px step, 320–2560px range) |\n| 自定义输入 / Custom input | 设置页可手动"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"输入任意像素值，非法输入自动钳制/拒绝\nType any pixel value in the settings page; invalid input is clamped or rejected "},{"id":"p16s7","text":"|\n| 持久化 / Persistence | localStorage 持久化；拖动时 300ms 节流写入，操作结束立即写入\nPersisted via localStorage; writes "},{"id":"p16s8","text":"are throttled at 300ms while dragging and flushed immediately on release |\n| 会话内即时生效 / Live effect |"},{"id":"p16s9","text":" 宽度实时作用于文档样式表，无需刷新页面\nWidth applies to the live stylesheets instantly — no page refresh needed |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 安装 / Installation"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 方式一：plugin-registry（推荐，需宿主已集成 plugin-registry）"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**中**：通过 `dsh plugin` 命令安装与管理，安装默认禁用、显式启用，Web 刷新后实时挂载。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**EN**: Install and manage via the `dsh plugin` command. Installed disabled by default, enabled expl"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"icitly, mounted live after a Web refresh."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 方式二：官方通道（config.yaml insert，未集成 registry 时用）"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**中**：一键安装脚本自动装入 DSH 并写入配置。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**EN**: A one-command install script that links the plugin into DSH and writes the config."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"重启 `dsh web` 生效。 / Restart `dsh web` to activate."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> **中**：私有仓库，仅限 chen-001 组织成员使用。\n> **EN**: Private repository, for chen-001 org members only."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## 两种分发形态 / Two Distribution Forms"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| 形态 / Form | 清单 / Manifest | bundle | 管理 / Management |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| registry 插件 / Registry plugin | `dsh.plugin.json`（`id: chen-001/dsh-chat-width`） | 根目录 `client.js`"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"（banner id = 插件 id，无 `@`）\nroot `client.js` (banner id = plugin id, no `@`) | `dsh plugin` / Web 面板，安"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"装默认禁用、显式启用\n`dsh plugin` / Web panel, installed disabled, enabled explicitly |\n| 官方包 / Official packa"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ge | `package.json#dshClient` | `lib/client.js`（banner id = 包名 `@chen-001/dsh-chat-width`） | `config"},{"id":"p30s5","text":".yaml` insert + pnpm link |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**中**：两者是同一功能的两种发布形态，bundle 各自构建、互不影响；registry 通道启用后请从 `config.yaml` 移除旧 insert 行，避免双份注册。"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**EN**: The two are two release forms of the same feature; each bundle is built independently and th"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ey do not interfere. After enabling the registry channel, remove the old insert line from `config.ya"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ml` to avoid double registration."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 技术实现要点 / Technical Highlights"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| 要点 / Highlight | 说明 / Description |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| 零核心改动 / Zero core changes | 不动 DSH 内核，仅操作文档样式表 + 插槽注册，配置即安装\nNo DSH core changes — only live styles"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"heets + slot registration; config is the install |\n| 手柄定位\"实测不假设\" / Measured, not assumed | 手柄钉在输入卡（`"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"[data-composer-seat]`）边缘，通过 `--dsh-composer-card-max-width` 的 live var() probe 实测宽度；无卡片时回退到滚动区中心公式并钳"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"制\nGrips pin to the composer card edges via a live `var()` probe; fall back to the scroll-area center"},{"id":"p35s5","text":" formula with clamping when no card exists |\n| 可见性声明式 / Declarative visibility | `body:has([data-con"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"versation-scroll])` + hover 透明度：仅聊天渲染时存在手柄、悬停才显示，页面上无永久竖线\n`body:has(...)` + hover opacity: grips exi"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"st only while a chat renders and show only under the pointer — no permanent vertical lines |\n| 布局漂移跟"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"随 / Layout drift tracking | window resize + MutationObserver（rAF 合并）重定位手柄，覆盖切会话/折叠侧栏等场景\nwindow resiz"},{"id":"p35s9","text":"e + MutationObserver (rAF-coalesced) re-pins the grips across session switches, sidebar collapses, e"},{"id":"p35s10","text":"tc. |\n| Cordis 语义正确 / Correct Cordis semantics | `ctx.effect` 返回 disposer 闭包，保证手柄生命周期与插件一致、卸载时正确清理\n["},{"id":"p35s11","text":" Cordis 语义正确 / Correct Cordis semantics | `ctx.effect` 返回 disposer 闭包，保证手柄生命周期与插件一致、卸载时正确清理\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
